    "一个温和的轻断食计时器。\n不打卡，不催促，不制造焦虑。\n按你的节奏来。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A gentle intermittent fasting timer.\nNo streaks. No pressure. No anxiety.\nAt your own pace."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个温和的轻断食计时器。\n不打卡，不催促，不制造焦虑。\n按你的节奏来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一個溫和的輕斷食計時器。\n不打卡，不催促，不製造焦慮。\n按你的節奏來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
